sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as pymarketplaces
    participant C as lengow-core (render API)
    participant P as PostgreSQL (products)
    participant F as Cache file
    participant MK as Marketplace
    PM->>C: pull feed via render API
    alt no usable cache
        C->>P: read products and render
    else cache passthrough
        C->>F: read previously rendered file
    end
    C-->>PM: stream feed
    PM->>MK: push via API
    MK-->>PM: publishing report
